    "# ️ Glu-Stock: 02_STRATEGIC_BRAIN\n",
    "**Phase**: Strategic Intelligence (The Auditor) | v18.26.6 (Self-Sequencing)\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook waits for the Inference Engine (01) via polling and performs the Strategic Audit."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
